doi rodo: Being optimistic, let's say that we find a way to upload en
masse to last.fm; looking over the API functions, it appears that in
addition to attaching mp3s, we can create items as well, which means
that (quite possibly) we can circumvent all manual updating.

However, aside from mp3 creation, there's one more element that can't
be automated: simplifying the definitions. For this task, contrary to
the appearances of the spreadsheet, you don't need to register for
anything (not even Google Docs). We've still got over 4000 to go,
so... anyone feel free to add a few:

http://tinyurl.com/smartfmgismu
Click on the sheet called "items" (at the bottom of the page), and
find empty entries in the column "Simplified Definition for Smart.fm"
by hitting "<ctrl> + <down>"

